/-- First curry (peeling off `ψ`), leaving the `(φ, x)` pair bundled: an element of
`𝒰→𝒰 → funSpace ((𝒰→𝒰) × 𝒰) 𝒰`. -/
noncomputable def curryOnceC (c : ApproximableMap U U) :
    ApproximableMap (funSpace U U) (funSpace (prod (funSpace U U) U) U) :=
  curry (RMap c)

